{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32915","headline":"春日题山家 · 李郢","name":"春日题山家","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"偶与樵人熟，春残日日来。\n依岗寻紫蕨，挽树得青梅。\n燕静衔泥起，蜂喧抱蘂回。\n嫩茶重搅绿，新酒畧炊醅。\n漠漠蚕生纸，涓涓水弄苔。\n丁香政堪结，留步小庭隈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32915.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32915","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}